  "details": "This doesn't happen with all groups, but when it DOES happen, it affects the group forever, so I can only describe what happens to me with certain groups:\n\n1. I open VRChat\n\n2. I open the menu\n\n3. I click \"groups\"\n\n4. In the left column, I see a group that I've joined has a red \"NEW\" label on it.  I click that group.\n\n5. It shows me the \"group info\" pane for that group.  The \"announcements\" tab does NOT have a red dot, despite the \"new\" label in the list on the left.\n\n6. I click the \"announcements\" tab anyway;  the pane says \"no announcements available\", BUT, the announcements tab itself now DOES have a red dot!\n\n7. No amount of clicking between tabs or groups or anything, not even relaunching VRChat, will ever clear the red \"new\" label on the group.",
